BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jacob Hackworth Live at Moonshine Alley!
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260811
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260812
DTSTAMP:20260811T112644Z
UID:62c4ee9c5c8bb94036072e07d4fb@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:ON SALE NOW Cat Country 98.1 presents Jacob Hackworth LIVE at 
 Moonshine Alley on Tuesday\, August 25th! MCA Records &amp\; Nashville sin
 ger and songwriter Jacob Hackworth is coming to Providence for one night o
 nly! Jacob is one of country music’s fastest-rising talents\, from his s
 ongwriting success (including Tucker Wetmore’s career-launching smash 
